    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BOOM!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1822070/extras/a8afecfeb6e579d7b5fa939783ff4603.poster.avif?t=1654673590\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1822070/extras/a8afecfeb6e579d7b5fa939783ff4603.gif?t=1654673590\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br>This chaotic fast-paced planetary defense game will have you shoot, jump, dash, and teleport across a fully destructible planet to fend off enemies flying in from all directions. Switch between multiple unique turrets, upgraded to suit your play style, for eye-popping synergetic plays!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BOOM!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1822070/extras/3f15445b794265413cdf758e10919b3f.poster.avif?t=1654673590\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1822070/extras/3f15445b794265413cdf758e10919b3f.gif?t=1654673590\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BOOM!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1822070/extras/af898d742b922c916765a3d0590dc9fe.poster.avif?t=1654673590\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1822070/extras/af898d742b922c916765a3d0590dc9fe.gif?t=1654673590\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>",
